### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8008

### Registrar nuevo Psicologo
POST {{baseUrl}}/psicologos/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "nombre": "Maria",
  "primer_apellido": "Garcia",
  "segundo_apellido": "Lopez",
  "documento": "44556677",
  "especialidad": "Psicologia Clinica",
  "password": "mi_password_seguro"
}

### Registrar segundo Psicologo
POST {{baseUrl}}/psicologos/b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
